If you're a neutral Valk, then Mojo is an awfully good weapon,
available awfully early.  If you're legal, Excalibur is even
better (IMHO), and typically available even earlier.

Making Sting is only interesting if you're chaotic (and not an
orc, obviously).

> 10. What gauntlets are better than power, dexterity? I suppose
